      "createdAt": 1775984506730,
      "changelog": "- Initial release of the graph-build skill, enabling code knowledge graph construction and incremental updates using Tree-sitter for multi-language AST parsing.\n- Stores graph data (nodes and edges) in an SQLite database at `.gauntlet/graph.db` with WAL mode for performance.\n- Supports full builds and incremental updates based on SHA-256 file hashing to skip unchanged files.\n- Extracts rich code relationships (CALLS, IMPORTS_FROM, etc.) from over 20 programming languages.\n- Includes user guidance for setup, usage scenarios, and recommended next steps after building the graph.",
